flexible keys, documents, graphs, series) or unstructured (files, free text).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step-2-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="120" width="600" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Category&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Which access pattern dominates? Joins and transactions, scans over columns, lookups by key, microsecond reads, time windows, relationships, full-text and geo queries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step-3-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="240" width="600" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Engine + Domain slice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The AWS Engine used in the workshop and the part of the e-commerce Domain its Engine App seeds and reads. One Engine App per Engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="548" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-notes" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not in the workshop (closed or gone)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• QLDB - end of support 31 July 2025&lt;br&gt;• CloudSearch - closed to new customers; use OpenSearch Service&lt;br&gt;• Timestream for LiveAnalytics - closed to new customers; use Timestream for InfluxDB&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Infographic corrections&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Keyspaces is listed under Geospatial, but it has no geo queries; the workshop uses OpenSearch geo_point.&lt;br&gt;• The infographic labels the time-series row as &quot;Graph&quot;; it is Time-series.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#248814'&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Structured · &lt;font color='#C925D1'&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Semi-structured · &lt;font color='#147EBA'&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Unstructured · &lt;font color='#D13212'&gt;┅┅&lt;/font&gt; not available&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry x="0" y="370" width="600" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>